flowchart LR
  subgraph ShortTerm[Short-Term Input]
    X[(X: T x H x W x C)] --> TDConv[TimeDistributed Conv2D blocks]
    TDConv --> TDFlat[TimeDistributed Flatten]
    TDFlat --> LSTM[LSTM stack]
  end

  subgraph LongTerm[Long-Term Input optional]
    LT[(x_lt: d_lt)] --> LTDense[Dense/Conv1D stack]
  end

  LSTM --> CAT[Concatenate]
  LTDense --> CAT
  CAT --> D[Dense stack]
  D --> UP[Up intensity softmax]
  D --> DOWN[Down intensity softmax]
